# Citation metadata for Isotherm++ (read by GitHub and Zenodo).
cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below."
type: software
title: "Isotherm++"
version: "2.0.0"
date-released: "2026-11-01"
abstract: >-
  Isotherm++ is a header-only C++20 library of single-component adsorption
  isotherm models for mass transport simulations. Each model returns the
  adsorbed amount and its exact derivative with respect to the independent
  variable, validates its parameters and gives read and replace access to them.
  All models share one interface, so the isotherm used by a solver can be
  changed without modifying the solver.
authors:
